.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt KST-DASHBOARD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kst-dashboard
.Nd a tmux layout of system health, htop, pools, snapshots and services
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -detach | -kill
.Nm
.Fl h | -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Opens a
.Xr tmux 1
session with
.Xr kst 8
and
.Xr htop 1
on the left and the pools, snapshots and services on the right, each
refreshing; or attaches to it if it is already running.
Inside it, Ctrl+a d detaches and Ctrl+a x closes a pane.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -detach
Start it without attaching.
.It Fl -kill
Close it.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print usage and exit 0.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tmux 1 ,
.Xr kldload-dash 8 ,
.Xr kst 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An kldload Aq Mt anthony@kldload.com
